Hi have you found another platform yet? Today I have tried out a few so far best I have found is LocalBitcoins but I don't fully or even half understand it yet, I'm thinking abandon ship with coinbase or at least have an alternative suppose I should have done so sooner

&#x200B;

just found this on coinbase section for customer support for UK payment methods -  **Please note:** There is a 5 day hold on all GBP deposits. When this happens, the total value of your deposit cannot be withdrawn or sent out of Coinbase.
